[32m+[m[32m(for other GPUs + cuda 11.6)[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIf you encounter slow download speed or timeout when downloading dependency packages,[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32myou need to consider installing the dependency packages from the mirror website first,[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32mand then execute the installation:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mpip install -r requirements.txt -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple[m
[32m+[m[32mpip install {Find the dependencies in setup.py:setup(install_requires=[...]) and write them down here} -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple[m
[32m+[m[32mpython setup.py develop[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe most recommended installation steps are:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Create a Python environment. Install [PyTorch](https://pytorch.org/get-started/previous-versions/)[m
[32m+[m[32mcorresponding to your machine's CUDA version;[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Install [mmcv](https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmcv) corresponding to your PyTorch and CUDA version;[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Install other dependencies of mmdet and install [mmdet](https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection);[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Install other dependencies of this project (Please change the spconv version[m
[32m+[m[32min the requirements.txt to the CUDA version you are using) and setup this project;[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Compile some operators manually.[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mcd mmdet3d/ops/csrc[m
[32m+[m[32mpython setup.py build_ext --inplace[m
[32m+[m[32mcd ../deformattn[m
[32m+[m[32mpython setup.py build install[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Install other dependencies of detectron2 and install [detectron2](https://github.com/facebookresearch/detectron2);[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### data preparetion[m
[32m+[m[32mIf your folder structure is different from the following, you may need to change the[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32mcorresponding paths in config files.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m├── mmdet3d[m
[32m+[m[32m├── tools[m
[32m+[m[32m├── configs[m
